<title>UK: UK grain traders seek free market wheat and barley.</title>
<headline>UK grain traders seek free market wheat and barley.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jan 9 (Reuter) UK traders have bid for licences to export free market wheat and barley at the weekly European Union tender, the Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce said.</p>
<p>The Board could give no further details, it said. Details are not given when there are less than three bids.</p>
<p>-- Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
